WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.799
You think faster than you type.

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:06.820
MrWhisper turns what you say into text, right on your Mac.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.280
Hold a key and speak.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.310
The text lands right where your cursor is, in any app.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:26.100
The transcription runs on your Mac, so your voice never leaves your computer.

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:31.598
Every dictation is saved in a searchable history.

00:00:31.648 --> 00:00:35.860
Tag it, rate it, and find anything you said in seconds.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.128
Working on one thing for a while?

00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:44.770
Session mode files everything you say in the right place, automatically.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.790
Deleted something by mistake?

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:57.510
The trash keeps it, and you can restore it any time.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:11.570
And if you like a bit of style, dress the whole app in leather and brass.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:20.577
MrWhisper.

00:01:20.627 --> 00:01:23.419
Your voice, your second memory.

00:01:23.469 --> 00:01:26.170
One purchase, no subscription.

